Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.23,0:23:40.98,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\an1\fad(1394,1)\fs16\c&HFDF5F9&\3c&H5A0A38&\blur3\b0\pos(303,207)}Precisamos de um herói
